NOTE ON DATA AND ASSETS / 数据与素材授权说明

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project only.

- Geographic boundary data in `maps/` is derived from DataV.GeoAtlas
  (https://geo.datav.aliyun.com/), which republishes map data originating from
  Amap / AutoNavi. It is NOT covered by the MIT license above. If you intend to
  use this project commercially or redistribute the map data, verify your own
  rights and obligations with respect to that data source.
- The globe/region attribute data under `data/` consists of independently
  written factual and descriptive text created for this project.

See `docs/attribution.md` for details.
